=== Sort the numbers 3, 1, 2 in PHP, give me the code
-- intent: write_program
Here is PHP code that sorts the numbers 3, 1, 2 in ascending order:

```php
<?php

$numbers = [3, 1, 2];
sort($numbers);
echo implode(", ", $numbers), PHP_EOL;
```

Result: 1, 2, 3

=== Sort the numbers 3, 1, 2 in PHP in reverse order, give me the code
-- intent: write_program
Here is PHP code that sorts the numbers 3, 1, 2 in descending order:

```php
<?php

